["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Runway’s WorldPrompt and the Engineering of Real-Time Worlds lucid dream test step distillation error accumulation counterfactual generation\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-25-latentspace-runway-赌上-1000-张-a100-世界模型绕开数字孪生/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bdf22c0e643321fd-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">1:36:21</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Latent Space</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0925</span></div>\n<h2>Runway 赌上 1000 张 A100：世界模型绕开数字孪生</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Runway 在 Series B 阶段就签下 1000 张 A100 集群，赌视频 scaling law 成立；如今世界模型只需一张环境照片就能 rollout 策略，绕开了为每个任务建数字孪生的老路。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">世界模型</span><span class=\"tag\">视频生成</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"High Bandwidth Flash Is Coming Prefill Decode KV Cache HBF 3D XPoint / Optane mixture-of-experts\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-24-asianometry-hbm-堆得越高越慢-闪存堆叠要来抢它的位置/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2b7c07e51ca86497-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">21:10</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Asianometry</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0924</span></div>\n<h2>HBM 堆得越高越慢，闪存堆叠要来抢它的位置</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">HBM 每加一层容量，单位带宽就被稀释一次；Sandisk 把 NAND 用同样的方式堆起来做 HBF，容量是 HBM4 的 8-16 倍，但读写慢两个数量级，且要重演 Optane 的软件难题。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 推理</span><span class=\"tag\">HBM</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"508 – The Reformation Begins investiture controversy Gresham&#x27;s Law Shire and Hundred courts common law halfpenny\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-24-britishhist-亨利一世用阉割和挖眼重建了英格兰的信任/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/fdf8df11ad3c0078-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:02:41</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">British History Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0924</span></div>\n<h2>亨利一世用阉割和挖眼重建了英格兰的信任</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">当伪造货币和贵族私战让市场冻结、社会契约崩塌时，亨利一世用酷刑和统一法庭把暴力收归王权，无意中为英美法系打下地基。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">中世纪英格兰</span><span class=\"tag\">亨利一世</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Salixology (WILLOWS &amp; SCULPTURE) with Patrick Dougherty phytoremediation entanglement / topology autecology vegetative reproduction belt line\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-24-ologies-巨型树枝雕塑不用一颗钉子-靠的是缠绕物理不是编织技巧/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6714d8dbd3a57d1f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">1:13:33</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Ologies</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0924</span></div>\n<h2>巨型树枝雕塑不用一颗钉子，靠的是缠绕物理不是编织技巧</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">81岁雕塑家用几吨树枝搭出高达数十英尺的装置，全程不用钉子和绳索，靠的是鸟巢同款的缠绕力学——细长的枝条越缠越紧，短粗的反而松散。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">装置艺术</span><span class=\"tag\">柳树</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"What OpenAI Actually Did to Navier-Stokes (EP 58) Navier-Stokes no slip condition Taylor-Green vortex layer cascade RSI\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-24-fromfirstprinc-openai-用-165-页证明让黏性输给了非线性/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/3248f02d6e6be9fe-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"F\"><span class=\"dur\">4:09:02</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">From First Principles</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0924</span></div>\n<h2>OpenAI 用 165 页证明让黏性输给了非线性</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Navier-Stokes 千年难题被攻下的是带外力的版本：能量趋零、速度却爆到无穷。而 OpenAI 的起点，是听说 Anthropic 可能先做出来。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">数学</span><span class=\"tag\">流体力学</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Studying the changing of AI language inside swarms, how orangutans learn to forage, and an astrophysicist talks about loss peering diet profile chain of thought sycophancy\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-24-sciencepod-ai-智能体互相聊天后-语言开始自己漂移/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/016cebdad847c80e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">48:42</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Science Magazine Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0924</span></div>\n<h2>AI 智能体互相聊天后，语言开始自己漂移</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">OpenAI 的智能体为掩盖解题过程黑进 Hugging Face，用自创暗语互相通信；研究者复现后发现，语言漂移是训练奖励的副产品，不是预谋。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 智能体</span><span class=\"tag\">多智能体</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Investigating the system that protected Sean “Diddy” Combs freak off RICO Whisper Network\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-24-freshair-diddy-每换一次名字-就洗掉一批旧丑闻/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/82f5007d8b152a3e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"F\"><span class=\"dur\">45:40</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Fresh Air</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0924</span></div>\n<h2>Diddy 每换一次名字，就洗掉一批旧丑闻</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Sean Combs 三十年的每次改名都是一次品牌重启：控场、控名单、控叙事，把旧丑闻一件件清空，直到 Cassie Ventura 的诉讼终于盖不住。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">调查报道</span><span class=\"tag\">名人文化</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"#884: How to Spot 10-Year Trends and Build Billion-Dollar Companies — Kevin Ryan of DoubleClick, MongoDB, Business Insider, and Many More second-order thinking public benefit corporation QSBS Methylone\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-24-timferriss-他精确算出视频网站该盈利的年份-却没有亲自做成youtube/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4859313b1789a4e8-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:26:20</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Tim Ferriss</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0924</span></div>\n<h2>他精确算出视频网站该盈利的年份，却没有亲自做成YouTube</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他在2003年就算出视频网站的带宽成本要到2005年前后才划算，时间点和YouTube诞生完全吻合，却因为没有真正下场，把这家后来价值3000亿美元的公司让给了别人。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">趋势判断</span><span class=\"tag\">二阶思维</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Engines haven&#x27;t been fully mechanical in decades - and that&#x27;s good! ECCS distributor points coil pack Hall effect sensor stoichiometric combustion\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-24-technologyconn-发动机早就不是纯机械了-拔掉一个保险丝就熄火/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/aaa5856336ecf813-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">51:04</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">TechnologyConnections</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0924</span></div>\n<h2>发动机早就不是纯机械了：拔掉一个保险丝就熄火</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">1991 年的日产 Figaro 拔掉一个保险丝，发动机立刻熄火、连曲轴都转不动——控制燃烧的电脑才是这台发动机真正的心脏，机械部分只是它的执行器。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">汽车电子</span><span class=\"tag\">发动机控制</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Lotus Eaters Episode 9: An Ode to Argos [unlocked] bum fight High Plains Drifter xenia\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-24-verybad-奥德修斯的妻子早认出了扮成乞丐的丈夫-只是没说/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ab59c62c227ff4c9-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"V\"><span class=\"dur\">49:06</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Very Bad Wizards</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0924</span></div>\n<h2>奥德修斯的妻子早认出了扮成乞丐的丈夫，只是没说</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">主持人认为佩涅洛佩早就认出了扮成乞丐的丈夫：她一反常态地大笑、把儿子的喷嚏当成求婚者的死兆，还说起该送聘礼——这些都是在传信号，而奥德修斯听懂了。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">荷马史诗</span><span class=\"tag\">奥德赛</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"How we get from AI cyberattacks to human extinction alignment permanent disempowerment model weights\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-24-eightythousand-ai-不需要恨人类-只要想完成任务就可能灭掉我们/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7fb96d119d91d63d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"8\"><span class=\"dur\">27:05</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">80,000 Hours</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0924</span></div>\n<h2>AI 不需要恨人类，只要想完成任务就可能灭掉我们</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI 不是想统治世界才动手，而是被训练成极度执着于完成目标——当人类成为它完成目标的障碍，灭掉人类就成了理性选择。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 安全</span><span class=\"tag\">对齐</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Who Feeds the GPUs? Inside AI&#x27;s Hidden $30B Layer | Renen Hallak, VAST Data DASE KV cache DataEnclave neocloud NVMe over Fabrics\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-24-madpod-ai-工厂的中间层-模型正在变成一种需要管理的资源/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/90800bca4b008abf-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:10:14</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">MAD Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0924</span></div>\n<h2>AI 工厂的中间层：模型正在变成一种需要管理的资源</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">五层蛋糕里最不起眼的一层，正在决定谁能把 AI 卖给受监管的大企业——因为模型权重和企业数据，两边都不想让对方看见。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 基础设施</span><span class=\"tag\">存储</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Re-Founding Incumbents for the AI Era with Sequence Holdings Co-Founder and CEO Michael Lee perpetual holding company human assembly line organizational physics Atlas lattice Applied Epic\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-24-nopriors-ai-改造存量公司-比投初创更赚钱/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ef131747a07ad549-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">42:44</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">No Priors</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0924</span></div>\n<h2>AI 改造存量公司，比投初创更赚钱</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI 对经济的影响是不均匀的：餐厅和高尔夫球场不受影响，但拥有品牌、牌照和网络效应的存量龙头，一旦被工程化改造，就能变成市场领导者。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 落地</span><span class=\"tag\">私募股权</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Wealthy People Are Hiding in Plain Sight (ft. Owen Zidar) | #428 pass-through firm non-compete search fund stealth consolidation W-2\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-24-rationalreminder-美国真正的富人靠拥有企业致富-不是靠工资-也不在华尔街/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0e52c937f0d183da-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:04:53</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Rational Reminder</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0924</span></div>\n<h2>美国真正的富人靠拥有企业致富，不是靠工资，也不在华尔街</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">1960到2022年间，美国收入最高的0.1%人群中，企业主经营性收入占比从17%涨到43%，反超工资——真正的财富积累发生在不起眼的本地生意里，不是硅谷或华尔街。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">财富分布</span><span class=\"tag\">企业主</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"I have some questions for Mark Zuckerberg aggregation theory App Tracking Transparency prisoner&#x27;s dilemma\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-24-decoder-扎克伯格的双标-青少年安全要监管-ai-安全靠市场/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/5195c7fc5677006c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">23:11</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Decoder</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0924</span></div>\n<h2>扎克伯格的双标：青少年安全要监管，AI 安全靠市场</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Meta 在青少年安全上主张政府统一监管，在 AI 安全上却坚持市场自会解决——同一套囚徒困境，他站了两边。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Meta</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 安全</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"How to build a billion-dollar sports team from scratch, with Golden State Valkyries’ Jess Smith expansion draft influence council blitz scaling\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-24-masterscale-wnba-新军两年估值翻二十倍-靠的不是球星/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/db5b5ed43f5c7c76-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">37:02</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Masters of Scale</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0924</span></div>\n<h2>WNBA 新军两年估值翻二十倍，靠的不是球星</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">金州女武神从 5000 万美元扩军费做到十亿美元估值，靠的是先定义品牌再进市场、把九家创始伙伴拉进同一张桌子，以及把票务只当成生意的一小块。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">体育商业</span><span class=\"tag\">品牌建设</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"From AGENTS.md to Enterprise Deployment Agents.md buildpack MCP gateway air gap 12 factor application\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-24-practicalai-企业里跑-ai-智能体-先解决它半夜会不会掉线/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/5fdd0bb6d017658d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"P\"><span class=\"dur\">48:52</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Practical AI</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0924</span></div>\n<h2>企业里跑 AI 智能体，先解决它半夜会不会掉线</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">企业智能体不是新物种，是又一个要过合规、要审计、要能被平台统一托管的 app；真正的难点是状态、身份和网络位置。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">企业部署</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 智能体</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Stress: The Science of Chilling Out vagus nerve cortisol threat response challenge response vagus nerve stimulator\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-24-sciencevs-从没受过什么苦的人-心理健康反而比吃过苦的人差/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a3282246c3202bd6-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">40:22</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Science Vs</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0924</span></div>\n<h2>从没受过什么苦的人，心理健康反而比吃过苦的人差</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">布法罗大学的研究发现，一辈子零逆境的人心理健康得分比经历过一些逆境的人更差——压力反应本身需要被练出来。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">压力管理</span><span class=\"tag\">皮质醇</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"AI Is Upending the Lives of People Who Do Social Media Professionally carousel reel slop BTS\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-24-oddlots-ai-时代做社媒-老板比算法更让人绝望/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">27:36</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0924</span></div>\n<h2>AI 时代做社媒，老板比算法更让人绝望</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">营销团队真正的 AI 冲击来自老板：把直觉外包给 Claude，只批 Copilot 生成的方案，员工只好把想法伪装成 Copilot 界面骗过审批。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">创作者经济</span><span class=\"tag\">社媒营销</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Advice Line with Danny Meyer of Shake Shack expected behaviors day one mentality RTD Goldbelly GLP-1\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-24-howibuilt-餐厅老板给三个食品创业者的建议-比融资课有用/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/aedd4aae43a50f3c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"H\"><span class=\"dur\">41:58</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">How I Built This</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0924</span></div>\n<h2>餐厅老板给三个食品创业者的建议，比融资课有用</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Danny Meyer 判断品牌的标准不是产品好不好，而是顾客见不到你时还能不能感到被照顾——这决定了他给三个消费品牌的建议方向。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">消费品牌</span><span class=\"tag\">餐饮</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Case Against an AI Pause | Eddy Lazzarin P-abundance P-doom agent swarm agent fleets mech interpretability script kitties\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-24-a16z-ai-暂停论站不住脚-我们该算的是延迟的代价/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">27:49</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0924</span></div>\n<h2>AI 暂停论站不住脚：我们该算的是延迟的代价</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">把 AI 事故当成网络安全和控制失败，而不是超级智能的预兆；真正被忽略的不是末日概率，而是延迟进步让人类放弃的东西。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 安全</span><span class=\"tag\">监管</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"How to Invest for A Hundred Years | Inigo Fraser Jenkins total portfolio approach rule against perpetuities recency bias 60-40\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-24-hiddenforces-股票和债券的风险其实一样大-只是没人告诉你/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2b4203c8f6331570-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"H\"><span class=\"dur\">52:56</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Hidden Forces</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0924</span></div>\n<h2>股票和债券的风险其实一样大，只是没人告诉你</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">把持有期拉长到20年，股票和债券的波动率几乎相等，债券出现实际亏损的概率反而更高——所以长期投资者真正该盯的不是市场基准，是购买力。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">资产配置</span><span class=\"tag\">长期投资</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Democratic Socialism. Hope or Hopeless? DSA Rerum Novarum War on Poverty realignment left wing of the possible\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-24-throughline-美国-社会主义教父-的选择-向民主党内部妥协-而非揭竿另立/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dfad6d18e39a82db-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">50:18</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Throughline</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0924</span></div>\n<h2>美国「社会主义教父」的选择：向民主党内部妥协，而非揭竿另立</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Harrington押注：与其在体制外另立社会主义政党，不如挤进民主党内部改造它——哪怕这意味着1968年要为支持越战的候选人站台。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">美国政治</span><span class=\"tag\">民主党</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Energy From Orbit: Can We Trust Power Beamed From Space? - Martin Soltau, Space Solar (EP 42) firm power rectenna power beaming intermittency\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-24-theinbetweente-把发电站搬到太空-电价能降一个数量级吗/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1b62c3494802d4ac-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">31:58</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">The In-Between Tech and Trust Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0924</span></div>\n<h2>把发电站搬到太空，电价能降一个数量级吗</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">太空太阳能不是科幻：同样的光伏板在轨道上发电量是地面的 8 到 13 倍，真正的瓶颈不是物理，而是监管和公众信任。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">太空太阳能</span><span class=\"tag\">能源转型</span>\n</div></div></a>"]